# Pickleball Carousel — Source of Truth

**Law:** Never edit carousel image lists directly in HTML files. Always edit the source of truth and run the build script.

## Source of Truth

`media/racquets/pickleball/pickleball-images.md`

This markdown file contains all pickleball carousel images organized by section:
- `## General` — standard club photos
- `## Halloween` — Halloween Mixer 2025 event
- `## Beachlife` / `## Tito` — Beachlife x Tito's 2025 event

## Workflow

1. **Edit the markdown** — add, remove, or reorder image URLs in `pickleball-images.md`
2. **Run the build script:**
   ```bash
   node scripts/build/build-carousel.js scripts/build/carousel-configs/pickleball.json
   ```
3. The script injects updated images into all target HTML files

## Target Files (auto-updated by build)

- `Components/Index/carousel-pickleball-homepage.html`
- `Pages/racquet-sports/Racquet Sports HTML.html`

## Config

`scripts/build/carousel-configs/pickleball.json` — defines source, targets, section→category mappings, alt text patterns

## Anti-patterns

- ❌ Editing `<img>` tags directly in carousel HTML
- ❌ Adding/removing images without updating the markdown
- ❌ Forgetting to run the build script after markdown changes

Direct HTML edits will be overwritten by the next build.
